</section>
</score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="1."><l>And leaving them (He was rejected),</l><l>He went out of the city (He went out to Bethany),</l><l>To Bethany (To Bethany),</l><l>And He lodged there (Every night from Jerusalem),</l><l>He went out (He went out),</l><l>To Bethany (To Bethany),</l><l>In Bethany He was welcomed by His lovers.</l></lg>
<lg label="2."><l>Now when Jesus (He was in Bethany),</l><l>Was in Bethany (In the house of Simon),</l><l>A woman came to Him (Woman came to Him),</l><l>Having a flask (A precious alabaster flask),</l><l>Of ointment (Of ointment),</l><l>Of great value (Her life’s worth),</l><l>And she poured it on His head as He reclined.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In Bethany (That was His true home),</l><l>The Lord found a resting place (He was considered worthy),</l><l>Amidst whom He loved (Mary, Martha, Lazarus),</l><l>And who welcomed Him (How they honored Him),</l><l>They were ever (They were ever),</l><l>Ready to welcome Him (To welcome Him),</l><l>And to devote the best of their substance to Him.</l></lg>
</div>
</back></music></mei>